Package: zulake
Title: Inspect and Read 'Delta Lake' Tables
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("The delta-rs authors", role = "cph",
           comment = "Delta test tables in tests/testthat/fixtures")
  )
Description: Opens a 'Delta Lake' table where it is stored, on 'Azure Data
    Lake Storage Gen2', 'Azure Blob Storage' or local disk, and returns what
    the table's own log records as data frames: its versions and commits,
    the files of each version with their partition values, statistics and
    deletion vectors, its schema, protocol and properties, and the changes
    between two versions. Reads the table's data too, pruning files by
    partition values and statistics before downloading any of them. The log
    is replayed in R, following the 'Delta Lake' protocol
    <https://github.com/delta-io/delta/blob/master/PROTOCOL.md>.
